{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在部分短时段的信息密度明显偏高，尤其S05，感受词集中出现时容易让观众来不及消化；X的左右分栏更利于快速扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然更费眼，但【】突出关键心理变化、感受词按音乐时机出现，使观众不仅知道他在想什么，还能理解他为什么从怕给对方负担，逐渐走向渴望互相依靠、害怕失去，最后接受不确定性。尤其S06、S07、S11、S13，Y保留了X有所压缩的心理转折和因果关系，音乐感受也更具体，有声部、力度、音色和情绪之间的对应，因此整体叙事的连续性与细腻程度更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ba7351aa-e8bc-421e-9e26-c1a038ad9440", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T230503072993Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:05:46.112752+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "89d2b7e851bf3680be1d8ff18459aeace282585c471a0ae84a459738d374242a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachm